Package: RNAPeaks
Type: Package
Title: RNA-Binding Protein Peak Visualization and Analysis  
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Krushna", "Bhanushali",
           email = "Krushna.Bhanushali@unc.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Gilbert", "Giri",
           email = "Ggiri@unc.edu",
           role = c("aut")))
Description: Creates publication-quality visualizations of RNA-binding protein
    (RBP) peaks overlaid on gene structures derived from GENCODE GTF annotations.
    Key features include single-gene visualization with plot_gene(), multi-gene
    genomic region plots with plot_region(), optional BAM coverage tracks,
    splicing maps that quantify RBP binding frequency around exon-intron
    boundaries with createSplicingMap(), position-specific sequence motif
    frequency analysis via createSequenceMap(), splicing analysis around
    retained intron events via createRetainedIntronSplicingMap(), and motif
    analysis around retained intron events via createRetainedIntronSequenceMap().
